{"id":53520,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=53520"},"modified":"2026-10-02T09:44:18","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T08:44:18","slug":"ultra-trail-serra-de-grandola","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ultra-trail-serra-de-grandola\/","title":{"rendered":"Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>1 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partidas a partir das <strong>08:00<\/strong> no <strong>Complexo Desportivo Municipal Jos\u00e9 Afonso<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Gr\u00e2ndola<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o atrai centenas de atletas \u00e0 emblem\u00e1tica serra alentejana para uma jornada desportiva de pura supera\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com percursos desafiantes tra\u00e7ados por caminhos rurais, single tracks e florestas de sobreiros, os participantes podem competir no <strong>Trail Ultra (46 km)<\/strong>, no <strong>Trail Sprint (26 km)<\/strong>, no <strong>Mini Trail (13.5 km)<\/strong> ou participar na <strong>Caminhada (11 km)<\/strong> n\u00e3o cronometrada, usufruindo de abastecimentos refor\u00e7ados e apoio t\u00e9cnico de excel\u00eancia.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 da responsabilidade conjunta do Munic\u00edpio de Gr\u00e2ndola e do Clube Amiciclo, com o apoio do movimento associativo local.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Novembro de 2