v><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 1 de Novembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 16\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no dia 1 de Novembro de 2026 (Domingo), com secretariado, partidas e chegadas concentradas no Complexo Desportivo Municipal Jos\u00e9 Afonso, em Gr\u00e2ndola.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento inclui o Trail Ultra de 46 km (08:00), Trail Sprint de 26 km (08:30), Mini Trail de 13.5 km (09:30) e a Caminhada de 11 km (09:35).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o as fases de pre\u00e7os?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se na plataforma Stop&#038;Go at\u00e9 16 de Outubro de 2026, com valores faseados a partir de 20\u20ac (46K), 15\u20ac (26K), 12\u20ac (13.5K) e 10\u20ac (Caminhada 11K) na 1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 31 de Agosto.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui peitoral oficial, registo eletr\u00f3nico de tempos (exceto caminhada), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, apoio m\u00e9dico, balne\u00e1rios e medalha de finalista.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os resultados oficiais e tempos em tempo real ser\u00e3o disponibilizados na plataforma Stop&#038;Go e partilhados no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-01\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Complexo Desportivo Municipal Jos\u00e9 Afonso, Gr\u00e2ndola\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Gr\u00e2ndola\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de Gr\u00e2ndola e Clube Amiciclo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Ultra Trail Serra de Gr\u00e2ndola 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no dia 1 de Novembro de 2026 (Domingo), com secretariado, partidas e chegadas concentradas no Complexo Desportivo Municipal Jos\u00e9 Afonso, em Gr\u00e2ndola.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento inclui o Trail Ultra de 46 km (08:00), Trail Sprint de 26 km (08:30), Mini Trail de 13.5 km (09:30) e a Caminhada de 11 km (09:35).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como posso fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais s\u00e3o as fases de pre\u00e7os?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se na plataforma Stop&Go at\u00e9 16 de Outubro de 2026, com valores faseados a partir de 20\u20ac (46K), 15\u20ac (26K), 12\u20ac (13.5K) e 10\u20ac (Caminhada 11K) na 1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 31 de Agosto.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui peitoral oficial, registo eletr\u00f3nico de tempos (exceto caminhada), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, apoio m\u00e9dico, balne\u00e1rios e medalha de finalista.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os resultados oficiais e tempos em tempo real ser\u00e3o disponibilizados na plataforma Stop&Go e partilhados no portal Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69209,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed",